# Nodal geometry of the de Bruijn flow

Umbrella for the parabolic tools of route ZCG below the saddle: the Fock identity and parabolic
frequency, the zero number, Hermite blow-up at collisions, the local Dyson law with its mesh, cluster and maximum-principle
forms, the depth law, the dissipation of the depth moments, and the central inequality above the horizon and on
density-one heights. See `NodalGeometryOfTheDeBruijnFlow/README.md`.
